        ]
      },
      "worked": "Chain rule, with $y=(uv)^{-1}$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y'&=-(uv)^{-2}(u'v+uv')\\\\y'&=-\\frac{u'v+uv'}{u^2v^2}.\\end{align*}$$\nProduct rule, with $y=u^{-1}v^{-1}$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y'&=(-u^{-2}u')v^{-1}+u^{-1}(-v^{-2}v')\\\\y'&=-\\frac{u'v+uv'}{u^2v^2}.\\end{align*}$$\nQuotient rule, with $y=\\dfrac{v^{-1}}{u}$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y'&=\\frac{(-v^{-2}v')u-v^{-1}u'}{u^2}\\\\y'&=-\\frac{u'v+uv'}{u^2v^2}.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
